cbmp: cross-thread interrupt request for the VM (Lua 5.4.7).
Adds global_State.cbmp_interrupt (set from any OS thread via lua_cbmp_setinterrupt),
ORs it into the VM 'trap' (updatetrap / function entry) and, in luaG_traceexec, calls
the host callback stored in the thread extra space (luaE_cbmpinterrupt). Also zeroes
the main thread extra space in lua_newstate. Re-check on upgrade: lstate.h/lstate.c,
lapi.c, lua.h, lvm.c (updatetrap, startfunc), ldebug.c (luaG_traceexec).
